violent-python3
===============

Python 3 conversion of the source code from the book:

    Violent Python: A Cookbook for Hackers, Forensic Analysts, Penetration
    Testers and Security Engineers
    TJ O'Connor
    Syngress, an imprint of Elsevier, Inc., 2012
    ISBN 978-1-59749-957-6

