Bundled third-party files
-------------------------

These files are included as sample data for the book's exercises. They remain
under their own terms:

chapter04/geolite2_city.mmdb
    GeoLite2 City database, built 2020-05-27.
    This product includes GeoLite Data created by MaxMind, available from
    https://www.maxmind.com.
    Distributed under the MaxMind GeoLite2 End User License Agreement, which
    incorporates CC BY-SA 4.0: https://www.maxmind.com/en/geolite2/eula
    This copy is outdated. Section 6.3 of the EULA requires users to stop
    using and destroy old versions within 30 days of an updated release, and
    it makes no exception for teaching or exercises. Download a current
    GeoLite2 City database with a free MaxMind account
    (https://dev.maxmind.com/geoip/geolite2-free-geolocation-data) and save
    it as chapter04/geolite2_city.mmdb before running the chapter 4 scripts.

chapter02/debian_ssh_dsa_1024_x86.tar.bz2
    Pre-generated 1024-bit DSA keys affected by the Debian OpenSSL
    predictable-PRNG vulnerability (CVE-2008-0166), as referenced by the book.
    These keys are public knowledge and are included for the brute-force
    exercise only.

chapter03/ANONOPS_The_Press_Release.pdf
    Public document referenced by the book's PDF metadata exercise.

chapter03/firefox_profile/, chapter03/skype_profile/, chapter04/*.pcap,
chapter01/*.txt, chapter01/evil.zip, chapter02/*.txt, chapter06/mlb-cities.txt
    Sample data accompanying the book's exercises.
